WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.690
Watch the garden wake up as white petals open into morning light.

00:03.740 --> 00:08.280
The camera stays close while the flower shifts from a tight bud into a broad delicate shape.

00:08.330 --> 00:12.060
Tiny changes in color move across petals while green stems stay soft behind them.

00:12.110 --> 00:14.760
A few seconds become reusable clips with room to breathe.
